#
# GPIO device driver configuration
#

config GPIODEV
	tristate "GPIO character device support"
	depends on GPIOLIB && ARCH_DAVINCI
	default y
	help
	  This driver provides a character device interface (/dev/gpiodev)
	  for controlling GPIO pins on OMAP-L137/DA830 SoC.

	  The device supports ioctl-based GPIO control for setting and
	  reading GPIO pin values.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called gpiodev.
